<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Panel — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-6"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="docket-label">Signed in as</p><p class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight"></p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70"></span><form method="post" action="/admin/logout"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--quiet">Sign out</button></form></div></div><nav class="tab-bar" aria-label="Panel sections"><a href="/admin" class="tab-link">Transactions</a><a href="/admin/review" class="tab-link">Review queue<span class="tab-count" aria-label="the number waiting for review could not be read">?</span></a><a href="/admin/employees" class="tab-link">Employees</a><a href="/admin/locations" class="tab-link">Locations &amp; Wall Tags</a><a href="/admin/reports" class="tab-link">Reports</a><a href="/admin/anomalies" class="tab-link">Anomalies</a><a href="/admin/policies" class="tab-link">Policies</a><a href="/admin/account" class="tab-link">Account</a></nav>  <form class="filter-bar" method="get" action="/admin/reports" aria-label="Choose a week"><div class="filter-field"><label class="docket-label" for="report-week">Week containing</label> <input class="filter-input" id="report-week" type="date" name="week" value="2026-09-07"></div><div class="filter-actions"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Show</button> <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/admin/reports?week=2026-09-06">Previous week</a> <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/admin/reports?week=2026-09-14">Next week</a> <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/admin/reports">This week</a><a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/admin/reports.csv?week=2026-09-07" download>Download CSV</a></div></form><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink/85">The CSV holds every person and every open check-in — the lists below are shortened, the file is not.</p>    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink/85">Mon 7 – Sun 13 September 2026 <span class="text-ink/70">· Europe/Malta</span></p><section class="docket"><p class="docket-label">Hours worked this week</p><p class="font-mono text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">8h 00m</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink/85">1 shift across 1 person.A shift counts on the day it STARTED, so an overnight shift belongs to the evening it began.</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div></section> <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Per person</h2> <div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><section class="docket"><div class="report-head"><p class="report-who">Maria Borg</p><p class="report-total">8h 00m</p></div><p class="docket-label mt-1">1 shift</p><dl class="report-days"><div><dt class="docket-label">Mon 7</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div><div><dt class="docket-label">Tue 8</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div><div><dt class="docket-label">Wed 9</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div><div><dt class="docket-label">Thu 10</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div><div><dt class="docket-label">Fri 11</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div><div><dt class="docket-label">Sat 12</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div><div><dt class="docket-label">Sun 13</dt><dd class="report-day">—</dd></div></dl></section></div> <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Per venue</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><section class="docket"><div class="report-head"><p class="report-who">St Julians</p><p class="report-total">8h 00m</p></div><p class="docket-label mt-1">1 shift started here</p></section></div> </main></body></html>